hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27827","Abd al-Samad narrated to us: Hammam narrated to us: Qatadah narrated to us, from Salma bint Hamzah, that her freedman died leaving a daughter, so the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, gave his daughter half as inheritance and gave Ya'la half, and he was the son of Salma."
